  ],
  "translation": "Na nau, luk, mi opim yu tudade long ol sen i stap long han bilong yu. Sapos i gutpela long ai bilong yu bilong kam wantaim ⟨את⟩ mi long Babel, kam, na bai mi putim ⟨את⟩ ai bilong mi long yu. Tasol sapos i no gutpela long ai bilong yu bilong kam wantaim ⟨את⟩ mi long Babel, no ken kam; luk, graun olgeta i stap long pes bilong yu — long gutpela hap na long hap i stret long ai bilong yu bilong go, go long en.",
